🔹 Topics Covered
1️⃣ Bootstrap Components

Bootstrap provides pre-designed components that can be easily used with classes:

Buttons → Styled buttons using btn classes
Cards → Content containers with images and text
Navbar → Navigation bar for websites
Alerts → Display important messages
Modals → Popup dialog boxes
2️⃣ Advantages of Bootstrap Components
Reduces development time
Easy to use and customize
Responsive by default
Consistent design across pages
